{
 "quickdraw": [
  {
   "html": "<p>您需要在所需的任何仓库中创建“新问题”或“请求”</p>",
   "img": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4xmen/Get-Github-Achievements/main/assets/img/quickdraw/quickdraw-step1.png",
   "small": false
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>现在你应该写一个标题并留下评论（如果你愿意的话）。然后单击“提交新问题”按钮</p>",
   "img": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4xmen/Get-Github-Achievements/main/assets/img/quickdraw/quickdraw-step2.png",
   "small": false
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>写下你想要的任何评论（你可以关闭问题或拉取请求，也不需要评论。），然后点击关闭问题/关闭拉取请求</p>",
   "img": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4xmen/Get-Github-Achievements/main/assets/img/quickdraw/quickdraw-step3.png",
   "small": false
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>完成，现在你可以在你的成就列表中看到Quickdraw成就</p>",
   "img": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4xmen/Get-Github-Achievements/main/assets/img/quickdraw/quickdraw-step4.png",
   "small": true
  }
 ],
 "yolo": [
  {
   "html": "<p>首先，您需要打开仓库并转到设置</p>",
   "img": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4xmen/Get-Github-Achievements/main/assets/img/yolo/yolo-step1.png",
   "small": false
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>其次，您需要转到合作者类别，邀请一个您有权访问仓库的帐户</p>",
   "img": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4xmen/Get-Github-Achievements/main/assets/img/yolo/yolo-step2.png",
   "small": false
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>您需要向仓库中添加一个新分支</p>",
   "img": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4xmen/Get-Github-Achievements/main/assets/img/yolo/yolo-step3.png",
   "small": false
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>然后，您需要向创建的新分支添加一个文件</p>",
   "img": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4xmen/Get-Github-Achievements/main/assets/img/yolo/yolo-step4.png",
   "small": false
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>添加文件并提交其描述，最后提交您的更改</p>",
   "img": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4xmen/Get-Github-Achievements/main/assets/img/yolo/yolo-step5.png",
   "small": false
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>点击绿色按钮，比较并提取请求</p>",
   "img": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4xmen/Get-Github-Achievements/main/assets/img/yolo/yolo-step6.png",
   "small": false
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>将步骤2中的受邀人员添加为审查者，并创建拉取请求</p>",
   "img": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4xmen/Get-Github-Achievements/main/assets/img/yolo/yolo-step7.png",
   "small": false
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>最后，检查您的审查者，然后点击合并拉取请求</p>",
   "img": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4xmen/Get-Github-Achievements/main/assets/img/yolo/yolo-step8.png",
   "small": false
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>完成，现在你可以在你的成就列表中看到Yolo成就</p>",
   "img": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4xmen/Get-Github-Achievements/main/assets/img/yolo/yolo-step9.png",
   "small": true
  }
 ],
 "pull-shark": [
  {
   "html": "<p>您需要从仓库中获取分支（您可以分支任何您想要的仓库）</p>",
   "img": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4xmen/Get-Github-Achievements/main/assets/img/pull-shark/pull-step1.png",
   "small": false
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>当你的分叉仓库创建时，你需要对分叉仓库进行一些更改（任何更改，如添加新文件或对代码进行一些更改！）之后你需要转到拉取请求选项卡</p>",
   "img": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4xmen/Get-Github-Achievements/main/assets/img/pull-shark/pull-step2.png",
   "small": false
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>点击创建拉取请求按钮 ;</p>",
   "img": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4xmen/Get-Github-Achievements/main/assets/img/pull-shark/pull-step3.png",
   "small": false
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>现在你可以看到可以合并绿色文字，这代表你可以合并你的拉取请求，所以点击创建拉取请求按钮可以成功创建你的拉申请。然后等待您的请求被仓库的创建者合并。</p><p>你需要2个合并的拉取请求，才能获得Pull Shark成就</p>",
   "img": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4xmen/Get-Github-Achievements/main/assets/img/pull-shark/pull-step4.png",
   "small": false
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>完成，现在你可以在你的成就列表中看到Pull Shark成就</p>",
   "img": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4xmen/Get-Github-Achievements/main/assets/img/pull-shark/pull-step5.png",
   "small": true
  }
 ],
 "pair-extraordinaire": [
  {
   "html": "<p>您需要安装 <a href=\"https://desktop.github.com/\">GitHub Desktop</a> , 并从网上上克隆您的仓库。（如果发现任何错误，则需要从内部仓库文件中添加仓库）</p>",
   "img": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4xmen/Get-Github-Achievements/main/assets/img/pair-extraordinaire/pair-step1.png",
   "small": false
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>克隆仓库HTTPS链接并将其粘贴URL文本框.</p>",
   "img": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4xmen/Get-Github-Achievements/main/assets/img/pair-extraordinaire/pair-step2.png",
   "small": false
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>不使用筛选框，只需单击“新建分支”并为仓库创建新分支</p>",
   "img": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4xmen/Get-Github-Achievements/main/assets/img/pair-extraordinaire/pair-step3.png",
   "small": false
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>在标题框中添加摘要，然后添加描述，最后按用户名 GitHub 添加共同作者（您只需在仓库中提交一个文件（不要推送文件））</p>",
   "img": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4xmen/Get-Github-Achievements/main/assets/img/pair-extraordinaire/pair-step4.png",
   "small": false
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>现在检查 GitHub 上的仓库并添加转让人，然后单击“合并拉取请求”按钮（Pair Extraordinaire 将同时提供给两个帐户（您和共同作者））。</p>",
   "img": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4xmen/Get-Github-Achievements/main/assets/img/pair-extraordinaire/pair-step5.png",
   "small": false
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>完成，现在你可以在你的成就列表中看到Pair Extraordinaire成就</p>",
   "img": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4xmen/Get-Github-Achievements/main/assets/img/pair-extraordinaire/pair-step6.png",
   "small": true
  }
 ],
