 "galaxy-brain": [
  {
   "html": "<p>打开任意公开仓库的 Discussions 标签页，并选择 Q&amp;A 类别（或其他可以标记答案的类别）。GitHub 官方 Community 论坛已关闭成就功能，因此在那里的回答不再计入。</p>",
   "img": null,
   "small": false
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>现在你需要在你想要的任何类别中找到未回答的问题并回答问题</p>",
   "img": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4xmen/Get-Github-Achievements/main/assets/img/galaxy-brain/galaxy-step2.png",
   "small": false
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>写出问题的正确答案（你的答案必须是问题求助者选择的最佳答案）</p>",
   "img": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4xmen/Get-Github-Achievements/main/assets/img/galaxy-brain/galaxy-step3.png",
   "small": false
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>你需要在任何类别中提交两个答案才能获得Galaxy Brain成就</p>",
   "img": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4xmen/Get-Github-Achievements/main/assets/img/galaxy-brain/galaxy-step4.png",
   "small": false
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>完成，现在你可以在你的成就列表中看到Galaxy Brain成就</p>",
   "img": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/4xmen/Get-Github-Achievements/main/assets/img/galaxy-brain/galaxy-step5.png",
   "small": true
  }
 ],
 "public-sponsor": [
  {
   "html": "<p>（首先你需要知道，要想获得这个徽章，你需要信用卡和捐款）。然后你需要先打开GitHub赞助商页面，然后点击查看你的顶部附属按钮</p>",
